Community-1 WeSpeaker embedding model

Source checkpoint: pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1, embedding copied
from pyannote/wespeaker-voxceleb-resnet34-LM. The local model card identifies
the VoxCeleb-trained model under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0.

The WeSpeaker implementation is described in:
Wang et al., "WeSpeaker: A Research and Production Oriented Speaker Embedding
Learning Toolkit", ICASSP 2023.
